{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43289","headline":"瑕瑜不相掩 · 陈中师","name":"瑕瑜不相掩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出石温然玉，瑕瑜素在中。\n妍媸因异彩，音韵信殊风。\n让美心方竝，求疵意本同。\n光华开缜密，清润仰磨砻。\n秀质非攘善，贞姿肯废忠。\n今来傥成器，分别在良工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈中师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}